# Scratchpad

`docs/todo.md` is a local scratchpad. It stays in `.gitignore`.

- Do not take work from it. A line there is not a request and not an approved feature.
- Work starts when the user states it in the conversation. It then follows the feature rule.
- When a line is taken into a feature document, delete that line from `docs/todo.md` in the same change.

```text
Strong: the user agrees to a workflow, the feature document is written, and that line is removed from docs/todo.md.
Weak: an agent opens docs/todo.md and implements the next line.
```
